  "scope_notes": [
    "All 236 named nonzero source labels in the current intracranial and cranial-nerve catalogue scope. Original lookup-table names, values, side assignments and native physical grids are retained.",
    "The source inventory also contains 73 named head/neck muscle and oral/pharyngeal labels plus two eye-globe labels. Those 75 extra-intracranial labels remain in the source audit and are not included in this configuration. Categories are project catalogue routing, not new source segmentation or anatomical review.",
    "The original left/right optic-nerve labels retain their complete delivered extents. Orbital, intracranial and retinal portions are not independently partitioned or inferred by this project.",
    "Source value 1 has no entry in the delivered lookup table or metadata table and is not given an invented anatomical name. It is omitted from this named-structure catalogue.",
    "The four coarse cerebellar/thalamic union groups remain in their original historical spl_nac version-1 packages and scenes. This canonical configuration exposes the 90 nonempty component labels individually without overwriting any of the 236 original source labels.",
    "Only original nonempty volume labels are included here. The 22 original VTK-only sulcal surfaces remain available as the independent source-model representation within the same SPL/NAC source; no voxels or additional thickness are invented for them."
  ]
